          {
            "id": "L-S1E06-C01-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Obviously, nothing's gonna come out of it. I mean, I may never see him again. And nobody wants a phone thing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E06-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Though I do like the sound of his voice. It's low and smart-sounding and kind of soothing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E06-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "And his eyes... his eyes are, like, this green-gray color that's not really a color, you know? Like, they're green when he wears green, and then..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E06-C01-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Oh, my God. Who am I right now?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E06-C01-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Emma",
              "version": "Emma"
            },
            "text": "A normal teenager? Though I do love hearing you talk about something as simple as having a crush on a boy. You do not need a counselor, Hope. You need a friend."
          }
          
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
         {
            "id": "L-S1E06-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Though I do like the sound of his voice. It's low and smart-sounding and kind of soothing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E06-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "And his eyes... his eyes are, like, this green-gray color that's not really a color, you know? Like, they're green when he wears green, and then..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E06-C01-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Oh, my God. Who am I right now?"
          }
        ]
      }
